similar with attack2
```

attack chain of events and actions. Attack has start and end event. The first time attack part called (for example warning triggered), attack starts. Then action could end attack. For example parry can attack.cancel or attack execution could end attack (like evt fire or cancel. Maybe attack start and attack end would be events with cancel and fire methods)

